# AMD64 thunk export spec -- mspatcha.dll.
#
# First DLL-under-test surface: mspatcha_test resolves every function it tests
# through LoadLibraryA("mspatcha.dll") + GetProcAddress, so the guest namespace
# must actually contain a mspatcha for those lookups to answer (the dispatcher
# overrides resolve both calls against guest modules only).  All 16 exports are
# integer/pointer-class and declared in include/patchapi.h.
DLL mspatcha.dll
FROM-SPEC auto
